{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010Features\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A casual game with roguelike elements where you fight alongside your fellows, decorated with style of a picture scroll.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010How to clear?\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find and destroy all the torii gates to survive the &quot;Hyakki Yako&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat enemies to collect orbs and enhance yourself and your fellows before taking on the challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2910990/extras/torii.gif?t=1738915306\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010Switching attack methods\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Left-click on the mouse or press the A button on a gamepad to switch between distribute and concentrate attacks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use it according to the situation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2910990/extras/gameplay.gif?t=1738915306\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010Place your fellows\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take advantage of your fellows characteristics when arranging them to create the strongest formation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2910990/extras/place.gif?t=1738915306\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010A wide variety of fierce warriors\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let's make good use of distinctive characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2910990/extras/select.gif?t=1738915306\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Battle start